{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/extras/BannerRecarved.png?t=1741545995\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BE THE BLADE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve through the battlefield, defeating peasants, knights, and others in rhythm-game-like combat. Maneuver yourself to match blocks and counters. Uncover unique combos, and learn how to wield yourself in the hands of different warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WEAR THE WIELDER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Swordsmen are disposable</i>; you are not. Experience the combat techniques and strength levels of different sword bearers. Use their lives to pursue your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES PLANNED FOR THE COMPLETED VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple weapon types with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue-like upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New endings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574540?t=1741545995","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/928f8c93d02bbefc8aaeac2d681d2db65448f286/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741545995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/e7bf3e70b390f6cda5a9df5ed1aef6c74b139731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741545995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/e7bf3e70b390f6cda5a9df5ed1aef6c74b139731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741545995","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description